.TH MSXBAS2ROM 1 "2026-10-29" "msxbas2rom 1.4.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
msxbas2rom \- compile MSX-BASIC source files into ROM images
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B msxbas2rom
.RI [ options ]
.I file.bas
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B msxbas2rom
is a command-line tool that converts MSX-BASIC source files into ROM
format. It supports plain ROM images and the ASCII8, ASCII16, ASCII16-X,
Konami and Konami SCC MegaROM mappers.
.PP
By default a plain ROM is generated next to the source file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-debug
Enable debug mode with detailed output.
.TP
.BR \-D ", " \-\-doc
Display the quick reference guide.
.TP
.BR \-H ", " \-\-history
Display the application history.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Display the application version.
.TP
.BR \-c
Plain ROM compile mode (default).
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-auto
Fall back to ASCII8 when the plain ROM overflows.
.TP
.BR \-x ", " \-8 ", " \-\-ascii8
Compile as an ASCII8 MegaROM.
.TP
.BR \-6 ", " \-\-ascii16
Compile as an ASCII16 MegaROM.
.TP
.BR \-7 ", " \-\-ascii16x
Compile as an ASCII16-X MegaROM.
.TP
.BR \-4 ", " \-\-konami
Compile as a Konami MegaROM.
.TP
.BR \-k ", " \-\-scc
Compile as a Konami SCC MegaROM.
.TP
.B \-\-pin\-game\-graphics
Keep game graphics resident or fail.
.TP
.BI "\-\-force\-overflow\-module " id
Force a module to overflow (testing).
.TP
.BI "\-i " path
Input path (default: source file path).
.TP
.BI "\-o " path
Output path (default: source file path).
.TP
.BR \-s
Generate symbols for Z80 debugging (default format: .noi).
.TP
.BR \-\-noi ", " \-\-noice
Generate symbols in .noi format (openMSX).
.TP
.B \-\-cdb
Generate symbols in .cdb format (sdcc).
.TP
.B \-\-symbol
Generate symbols in .symbol format (pasmo).
.TP
.B \-\-omds
Generate symbols in .omds format (openMSX, deprecated).
.TP
.B \-\-lin
Write MSX-BASIC line numbers in the generated binary.
.TP
.B \-\-vscode
Initialize a VSCode MSX-BASIC project in the current directory.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B msxbas2rom game.bas
Compile
.I game.bas
into a plain ROM.
.TP
.B msxbas2rom \-\-ascii8 game.bas
Compile
.I game.bas
as an ASCII8 MegaROM.
.TP
.B msxbas2rom \-\-noi game.bas
Compile and generate openMSX debug symbols.
